  <data name="Act02ATitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>The Morning Ash Village</value></data>
  <data name="Act02AObjective" xml:space="preserve"><value>Explore the devastated island and find the road into the feudal village.</value></data>
  <data name="Act02ATutorial" xml:space="preserve"><value>Daylight reveals houses, castles and mountains ruined by spirits and corrupted warriors.</value></data>
  <data name="Act02BTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>The Valley of Torn Banners</value></data>
  <data name="Act02BObjective" xml:space="preserve"><value>Endure the strong wind and reach the fortress at the island's edge.</value></data>
  <data name="Act02BTutorial" xml:space="preserve"><value>The gusts are visual and harmless; keep moving through the wreckage.</value></data>
  <data name="Act02CTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>The Fortress beneath Black Wings</value></data>
  <data name="Act02CObjective" xml:space="preserve"><value>Defeat the night boss and recover the second part of the Ash Seal.</value></data>
  <data name="Act02CTutorial" xml:space="preserve"><value>Nocturnal birds cross the map to distract you, but they cannot deal damage.</value></data>
  <data name="Act03ATitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>The Broken Castle Wall</value></data>
